,"body":"So I decided to test the \"leveldb2\" store and I've been dumping metadata using \"weed shell\" for the past 9 hours. And it's only 5% through (going by the size of the dump/backup file - but maybe it compresses \r\nto much less than the source data directory). \r\n\r\nSo if that's correct it's only dumping at around 26 file entries per second and still using 130% CPU.\r\n\r\nWould you expect to see faster than this?\r\n\r\nI also move the Filer metadata to an NVMe drive, which may have helped a little but still same CPU.\r\n\r\nIs there a way to quiet the text trace output, I assume this slows the dump a little.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/comments/507007552/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/comments/507010060","html_url":"https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/996#issuecomment-507010060","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaweedfs/seaweedfs/issues/996","id":507010060,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUwNzAxMDA2MA==","user":{"login":"momosnn","id":52339287,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzM5Mjg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52339287?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/momosnn","html_url":"https://github.com/momosnn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momosnn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momosnn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momosnn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momosnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momosnn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momosnn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/momosnn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/use